    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your village! Purchase cards and use buildings and heroes to create powerful combinations. Then go and plunder someone else's village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your strategy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Crossed Villages', you will build your own village and then plunder the enemy's village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat effectiveness of your village depends on your card selection and placement. The first to enter the center area of the opponent will win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village you are fighting against is a real player's village. Look at other players' combinations and find a way to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various card combinations in different styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We won't engage in battle, but will directly attack the Yellow Dragon and occupy the enemy's central area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it to reduce the enemy's alloy and give them a disadvantage in the upcoming battles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it using powerful cards to crush opponents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all depends on you</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your village! Purchase cards and use buildings and heroes to create powerful combinations. Then go and plunder someone else's village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your strategy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Crossed Villages', you will build your own village and then plunder the enemy's village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat effectiveness of your village depends on your card selection and placement. The first to enter the center area of the opponent will win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village you are fighting against is a real player's village. Look at other players' combinations and find a way to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various card combinations in different styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We won't engage in battle, but will directly attack the Yellow Dragon and occupy the enemy's central area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it to reduce the enemy's alloy and give them a disadvantage in the upcoming battles?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it using powerful cards to crush opponents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all depends on you</p>",
    "short_description": "A self-propelled chess game that builds your village and occupies the opponent's occupation points. Purchase buildings and heroes to build your own genre, and then learn from other players!",
